### Criar Pedido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "João Silva",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_name": "Notebook",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 2500.00
    },
    {
      "product_name": "Mouse",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 50.00
    }
  ],
  "payment": {
    "card_number": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
    "payment_type": "credit"
  }
}